      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] Now that `FindDfuInterface()` returns `std::expected\u003cDfuInterfaceInfo, RtsError\u003e` by value, storing `dfu_interface_` and `transfer_size_` as data members on `RtsUsbDevice` (and resetting them in `Release()`) is redundant in this CL and causes unnecessary churn when the child CL (`https://crrev.com/c/8629987`) immediately removes `dfu_interface_`, `transfer_size_`, `transfer_size()`, the `Release()` resets, and `ReleaseForgetsFoundInterface`.\n\nIn this CL, `dfu_interface_` is never read outside `DfuDetach()` (which already has `info-\u003enumber` locally), and `DfuDetach()` triggers USB re-enumeration so the device handle must be closed and re-opened before any download occurs. Please omit `dfu_interface_`, `transfer_size_`, and `transfer_size()` from `RtsUsbDevice` in this CL, pass `info-\u003enumber` directly in `DfuDetach()`, and leave `RtsUsbDevice::Release()` unchanged:\n\n```cpp\n  // Find the DFU interface first.\n  auto info \u003d FindDfuInterface();\n  if (!info) {\n    return std::unexpected(info.error());\n  }\n\n  // An interface-recipient request needs the interface claimed (which also\n  // detaches any kernel driver); otherwise usbfs warns and may return EBUSY.\n  InterfaceClaim claim(*backend_, info-\u003enumber);\n  if (auto claimed \u003d claim.Claim(); !claimed) {\n    return Fail(*backend_, \"Claiming the DFU interface\", claimed.error());\n  }\n\n  // bmRequestType \u003d 0x21: Host-to-Device, Class, Interface\n  // bRequest \u003d kDfuDetach (0x00)\n  // wValue \u003d detach_timeout in ms\n  // wIndex \u003d interface number\n  auto res \u003d backend_-\u003eControlTransferOut(\n      kBmReqH2dClsIf, kDfuDetach, static_cast\u003cuint16_t\u003e(detach_timeout.count()),\n      static_cast\u003cuint16_t\u003e(info-\u003enumber), {}, kUsbCtrlTimeout);\n```\n\nOther locations to update:\n* `util/realtekfp/rts5817_usb_device.cc` **lines 107–111**: Keep `void RtsUsbDevice::Release() { backend_-\u003eClose(); }` unchanged.\n* `util/realtekfp/rts5817_usb_device.h` **lines 162–163** and **lines 199–200**: Remove `transfer_size()`, `dfu_interface_`, and `transfer_size_`.\n* `util/realtekfp/rts5817_usb_device_test.cc` **line 613** and **lines 645–657**: Remove `EXPECT_EQ(device_-\u003etransfer_size(), 2048);` and `ReleaseForgetsFoundInterface`.\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/e0d899bb-ac40-40a8-a839-93b60aee117f)",
